pand include size: 2324/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 158/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 15347/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   13.480      1 -total\n 61.62%    8.306      1 Template:AMC10_box\n 37.30%    5.028      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:2483:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017144437 and revision id 287677. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}